  "<0>Information:</0><1/>These simulations are all based on the default profiles from SimulationCraft.<2/>You can consider everything within the target error DPS range to be mostly equal and requiring a more detailed investigation.": "<0>Information:</0><1/>这些模拟都基于SimulationCraft的默认配置文件。<2/>你可以将DPS误差范围内的所有内容视为大致相等，并且需要进行更详细的研究。",
  "<0>Last Update:</0>": "<0>最后更新:</0>",
  "<0>Target Error:</0>": "<0>目标误差:</0>",
  "<0>WoW-Build:</0>": "<0>WoW-Build:</0>",
  "Filters (Click to toggle them on/off from the results)": "过滤器 (在结果中显示/隐藏点击的天赋或者特质)",
  "Go to 404": "Go to 404",
  "Go to blog": "Go to blog",
