  "Go to faq": "Go to faq",
  "Go to rogue": "Go to rogue",
  "Here you can retrieve all the simulations we run. You will find more details about what they represents in their respective pages. They are updated on a daily basis.": "在这里你可以检索我们运行的所有模拟，你将在各自的页面中找到更多的详细信息，每天都会更新。",
  "Here, you can compare expected DPS increase from azerite powers.": "在这里，你可以比较艾泽里特之力的预计DPS收益。",
  "Here, you can compare expected DPS increase from trinkets.": "在这里，你可以比较饰品的预计DPS收益。",
  "If you are interested in how the different races in World of Warcraft compare for this build, you can check out the following chart. However, keep in mind that race differences are usually rather small and can change with balance and gameplay changes. You can always play the race you want to play and do not have to feel compelled to choose based on this chart.": "如果你对“魔兽世界”中的不同种族的收益感兴趣，你可以查看下面的图表。但是，请记住，种族差异通常很小，可能随着游戏平衡和游戏玩法的变化而变化。你可以玩你想玩的种族，而不必根据这个图表来选择。",
  "In order to compare azerite powers with this chart, look for the end of the bars corresponding to the item level of interest. However, you should <0>simulate your own character</0> to find your best setup. These simulations are based on predefined gear sets instead of your own, after all. This means data shown here <1>depends heavily</1> on the used profile with its talents, its gear, etc. and is rather giving an outlook. If your character is different from the setup used here, personal simulations are recommended.": "为了将艾泽里特之力与这个图表进行比较, 请查找感兴趣的条目以及对应的物品等级。但是，你应该 <0>模拟自己的角色</0> 来寻找最佳的配置。毕竟，这些模拟基于预设的装备方案而不是你自己的。这意味着这里显示的数据 <1>很大程度上取决于</1> 使用的配置文件及天赋，装备等。如果个人角色与此处使用的模板不同, 建议进行个人模拟。",
  "In order to compare trinkets with this chart, look for the end of the bars corresponding to the item level of interest. However, you should <0>simulate your own character</0> to find your best setup. These simulations are based on predefined gear sets instead of your own, after all. This means data shown here <1>depends heavily</1> on the used profile with its talents, its gear, etc. and is rather giving an outlook. If your character is different from the setup used here, personal simulations are recommended.": "为了将饰品与这个图表进行比较，请查找感兴趣的条目以及对应的物品等级。但是，你应该 <0>模拟自己的角色</0> 来寻找最佳的配置。毕竟，这些模拟基于预设的装备方案而不是你自己的。这意味着这里显示的数据 <1>很大程度上取决于</1>使用的配置文件及天赋，装备等。如果个人角色与此处使用的模板不同, 建议进行个人模拟。",
  "Of course, you can also check how the talents compare each other without any azerite power (just unselect all of them). Which is ideal in case you are using only generic azerite powers for example.": "当然，你也可以在没有任何专精艾泽里特之力的情况下比较天赋 (取消所有的艾泽里特之力选择)。例如，你只使用通用的艾泽里特之力，那么这是理想的选择。",
  "The fact that generic azerite powers are not included is intended. The goal of such simulations is not to find the best possibilities out of millions possible combinations but rather let you know <0>if a given azerite power alone could impact talents choices</0>. One of the caveat is that it could happen with further stacks or a combination of two of them, those cases are not covered there. You might find more information about such events on your class resources.": "事实上通用艾泽里特之力是故意没有包含在内的，这种模拟的目的不是要从数以百万计的可能组合中找到最好的可能性，而是让你知道 <0>单独一个特定的艾泽里特之力是否会影响天赋的选择</0>. 有一点需要预先声明，特质的叠加或者不同特质的组合并没有被包括在内。",
  "The purpose of these simulations is to get a general idea of how different setups will compare with each other and not to promote any definitive best builds. Several variables (like different trinkets, WF/TF or ingame situations) are not taken into account. This is why you, as always, should <0><1>simulate your own character</1></0> to find your optimal setup.": "这些模拟的目的是了解不同的组合如何互相比较，而不是去推荐最好的组合. 没有考虑到几个变量(比如不同的饰品，战火/泰坦造物)。这就是为什么你总是应该 <0><1>模拟你自己的角色</1></0> 来找到你的最佳设置。",
  "Welcome to Hero Damage": "欢迎来到 Hero Damage",
